BEHAVIOR crlf-needle

DESCRIPTION
  Writes the 4-byte HTTP header/body separator CR LF CR LF into needle at
  offsets 0..3, followed by a null terminator at offset 4 (so it is a valid
  null-terminated needle for find).

CONTRACT
  OUTPUT needle bytes 256
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 3190a1f5

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE needle 13 1 0    # CR
  STORE needle 10 1 1    # LF
  STORE needle 13 1 2    # CR
  STORE needle 10 1 3    # LF
  STORE needle 0 1 4     # null terminator
END
